WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Personalization you can control. Adapt through consented context with explanations and control.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
Use only consented context.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Show every adaptive input.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Explain why the system changed.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Offer a working off switch.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Adaptation should remain inspectable.
